cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Detecting Secret Loyalties in Language Models with White-Box Probes"
abstract: >-
  A principal-directed linear probe over final-token residual-stream activations, gated by its
  false-positive rate on the base model, that detects the presence and principal of narrow secret
  loyalties which black-box audits fail to catch. Validated on known-loyal model organisms and
  applied to a blind detection challenge; detection is shown to be per-principal.
type: software
